Krita Nova 33 - image size, rotation and zoom back in the top bar (Android)

Patch 16 parks the status bar's image size / memory, canvas rotation and zoom
widgets in a "KritaNovaStatusItems" widget, and patch 15 moves that to the
right end of the top bar - but only once, when the brush toolbar is arranged
for the Brush Panel. The widget only exists after the status bar has been set
up; when the toolbars were arranged first, it was never moved and the info
was missing from the UI.

KisMainWindow.cpp: ensureStatusItemsInTopBar() moves it (with the spacer
before it) to the top bar if it isn't there yet and shows it. It runs when the
brush toolbar is arranged, as before, and again every time the Brush Panel is
placed - after the window is shown and whenever a document is opened or
switched to - so it ends up in the top bar whichever comes first.
diff --git a/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp b/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
index 876300e..c4124ad 100644
--- a/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
+++ b/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
@@ -536,6 +536,26 @@ private:
